&lt;li&gt;In the event that a candidate does not have a Bachelor&#39;s Degree or Advanced Diploma in a related field, an equivalent experience requirement must be met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical acumen for integration&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand machine learning, LLM and AI concepts and how they can be used to benefit the system.&lt;/li&gt;
