&lt;li&gt;Able to prioritise and cope with competing priorities under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a fast-paced, sometimes less-structured, and constantly changing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to take initiative in ambiguous situations, by identifying critical problems and driving solutions with the relevant people.&lt;/li&gt;
