&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner, coach and support all employees on the full range of HR functions and support&amp;nbsp; including performance management, recruitment and selection, job evaluation, remuneration and benefits, induction, learning and development, employee relations and employee wellness ensuring consistency with relevant legislation and the company HR policy and procedure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implementation of the HR Strategy and policies in the business ensuring alignment to strategy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Undertake specific projects, in consultation with line management, to facilitate HR activities and enhance customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Hiring managers with organisational design and all talent acquisition activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide timeous and relevant HR management information to all relevant stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate payroll submissions and checks accurate and timeous delivery to ensure on time and accurate remuneration and benefits are paid to all employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner and support all employees with IR related incidents and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the onboarding process which includes drafting of contracts, gathering new starter data, ensuring first day readiness, induction etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct onboarding for all new appointees into the division&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct 3-month stay interviews with all new appointees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate all onboarding and resignation process to ensure a seamless transition for all parties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all employee systems are kept up to date&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support all employee relations processes with templates, documentation, scheduling and updating the employee relations database&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide monthly reports to the HRBP and Managers and Team Leads as required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage ad hoc projects from time to time as per the HR Strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide general administrative support to the HR Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist staff with day to day queries&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support and assist with any recruitment initiatives and processes such as open days, career fairs and interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound knowledge of labour laws and policies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven project management skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in Industrial Relations including the CCMA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
